From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: Aero Shake, and maximized windows fill a new screen.

A window shaken by its caption minimizes the other windows, which stay
so until the user brings them back.

As in Windows, a maximized window with a frame takes the work area again
when the display mode or the work area changes: a game of another
resolution left programs the size of the old screen, still maximized.
---
